Stockfish
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Stockfish chess engine
    Copyright (c) the Stockfish developers
    https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3

Stockfish is no longer shipped. It remains a development dependency, used
only by scripts/verify-endgames.mjs to check the endgame drill positions at
build time, because verifying a forced win needs exact search rather than a
prediction of human play.

